  "title": "Zesty Citrusy Portuguese Mozzarella Balls Skewers",
  "description": "A weeknight Portuguese dish featuring mozzarella balls with a zesty citrusy twist, perfect for a quick and delicious meal.",
  "cuisine": "Portuguese",
